Release history for Dist-Zilla-Plugin-GatherAgentContext

0.002     2026-10-25 18:38:49Z
    - Local state and secrets below a harness directory can no longer end up
      in the tarball. Below .claude/ and .codex/ only agent content is
      gathered now (agents/, skills/, rules/, hooks/, commands/, CLAUDE.md,
      skilletor.json, skilletor.lock.json, skilletor-rules.md); everything
      else there (.credentials.json, auth.json, config.toml, projects/,
      todos/, statsig/, local/, session logs, backups, ...) is never read,
      whatever it is called. To snapshot a further subdirectory, configure it
      by name ("dir = .claude/output-styles").
    - Built-in excludes cover any <name>.local.<ext> file (settings.local.json,
      settings.local.json.bak, CLAUDE.local.md) as well as .credentials.json
      and auth.json, at any depth.

0.001     2026-09-29 20:02:51Z
    - Initial release: snapshot agent context (.claude/.codex/CLAUDE.md/...)
      into the build under misc/agent-context/ for build provenance.
